  - name: Unusual Data Volume change
    detail: Looks for differences between daily data volume changes
    fluxfile: flux/data_volume_change.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    comparison: gt 
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - path
    interval: 3600
    target: postfix
    action: |
              There is a significant difference in the change of data volumes from on day to the next. This may indicate that 
              there is a problem with a process, an unusually large file creation or human error. Inpect the server and 
              volume manually to see what has changed dramatically in the last 24h. For example, use a "find -mtime -1" and look
              for any suspiciously large files. This is not criital. 
